     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: <strong class=\"gmail_sendername\" dir=\"auto\">Vincent Wanga</strong> <span dir=\"auto\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">vincen...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Fri, Dec 13, 2024 at 4:30 PM<br>Subject: Re: Question on Wallace<br>To: Wallace EcoMod &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">wallac...@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br></div><br><br><div dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/wallaceEcoMod/attach/4eeba31bab2dd/image.png?part=0.6&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"563\" height=\"370\"><br><div>Hello, I tried loading the shapefile for the study region,.shp,.shx,.dbf, but the interface freezes. is there anything I am not doing right? </div><div>I would appreciate your help.</div><div>Kind regards,</div><div>Vincent Wanga</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Sun, Nov 24, 2024 at 1:03 AM Vincent Wanga &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">vincen...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><p dir=\"ltr\">Thank you for your help.</p>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Sun, Nov 24, 2024, 00:58 Wallace EcoMod &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">wallac...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">The csv headers need to be lowercase: scientific_name, longitude, and latitude, and the species need to be written as Genus species, without the additional information. </div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wed, Nov 20, 2024 at 2:21 AM Vincent Wanga &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>vincen...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/wallaceEcoMod/attach/4eeba31bab2dd/image.png?part=0.4&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"563\" height=\"310\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/wallaceEcoMod/attach/4eeba31bab2dd/image.png?part=0.5&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"486\" height=\"212\"><br><div>Hello, </div><div>I am trying to load my dataset in the user-defined section, but it seems to bring errors. What could be the problem? My CSV file is arranged in the snipped piece above</div><div>Kind regards,</div><div>Vincent Wanga</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wed, Nov 20, 2024 at 12:36 AM Vincent Wanga &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>vincen...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you very much</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wed, Nov 20, 2024 at 12:27 AM Wallace EcoMod &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>wallac...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">You may receive an error trying to install regarding the package changeranger. That is currently off CRAN an also needs to be downloaded prior to installing v3 (apologies, I forgot to mention this). We are in the process getting it back on CRAN, but if you see the error, just run this first:<div><br></div><div>devtools::install_github(&quot;<a href=\"https://github.com/wallaceEcoMod/changeRangeR\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/wallaceEcoMod/changeRangeR&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490922110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3psLbwynLZ09OSfO2b70jM\">https://github.com/wallaceEcoMod/changeRangeR</a>&quot;)</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Tue, Nov 19, 2024 at 11:25 AM Vincent Wanga &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>vincen...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you very much, Bethany</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wed, Nov 20, 2024 at 12:21 AM Wallace EcoMod &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>wallac...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">V3 is available via github.<div>You can install it by running:<br>devtools::install_github(&quot;<a href=\"https://github.com/wallaceEcoMod/wallace/tree/biomodelos\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/wallaceEcoMod/wallace/tree/biomodelos&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490922110000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3FHx2aFQKob2-mV25SeyBe\">https://github.com/wallaceEcoMod/wallace/tree/biomodelos</a>&quot;).</div><div><br></div><div>-Bethany</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, Nov 18, 2024 at 2:20 AM Vincent Wanga &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>vincen...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><p dir=\"ltr\">Hello Bethany,<br>\r\nI also had one question is Wallace V. 3 ready to use, i wanted incorporate some biotic effects on the landscape to show future changes of species distribution.<br>\r\nI will appreciate it. <br>\r\nKind regards,<br>\r\nVincent Wanga</p>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, Nov 18, 2024, 14:30 Vincent Wanga &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>vincen...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><p dir=\"ltr\">I will try and change my network and see if it will work. <br>\r\n</p>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, Nov 18, 2024, 14:19 Vincent Wanga &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>vincen...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/wallaceEcoMod/attach/4eeba31bab2dd/image.png?part=0.3&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"563\" height=\"350\"><div>Now it gives me this error message when Ioad the file. Does it mean it downloads as one variable or?<br><div><br></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, Nov 18, 2024 at 2:00 PM Vincent Wanga &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>vincen...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><p dir=\"ltr\">Thanks so much, <br>\r\nlet me try it out. </p>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, Nov 18, 2024, 13:54 Wallace EcoMod &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>wallac...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"border-left:none;padding:0px;display:flex;font-family:&quot;Google Sans&quot;,Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:medium\"><div style=\"margin:0px;min-width:0px;padding:0px 0px 20px;width:initial\"><div><div style=\"direction:ltr;margin:8px 0px 0px;padding:0px;font-size:0.875rem;overflow-x:hidden\"><div style=\"direction:ltr;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-feature-settings:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:small;line-height:1.5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;overflow:auto hidden\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Apologies, I realized I replied with my personal account.<br>I was just going to suggest it might be a VPN issue. I tried it, and the link is functional. <div>I&#39;ve seen this problem before with an institutional vpn blocking automatic downloads or access to dropbox outside of the institution.</div><div><br></div><div>Here is the link to the data: try to download the files outside of wallace. you can then use the User-Specified module to upload the files instead of ecoclimate.</div><div><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/sh/kijh17ehg8v3uv8/AADh9RT99OC7J5wfJojxiJGQa/bio%20%23baseline_Modern%281950-1999%29%23%20CCSM_mHol%286ka%29.txt?dl=1\" rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.dropbox.com/sh/kijh17ehg8v3uv8/AADh9RT99OC7J5wfJojxiJGQa/bio%2520%2523baseline_Modern%25281950-1999%2529%2523%2520CCSM_mHol%25286ka%2529.txt?dl%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490922111000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JpuEsaIzeo3xftC3upkA9\">https://www.dropbox.com/sh/kijh17ehg8v3uv8/AADh9RT99OC7J5wfJojxiJGQa/bio%20%23baseline_Modern%281950-1999%29%23%20CCSM_mHol%286ka%29.txt?dl=1</a></div><div><br></div><div>Bethany</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, Nov 18, 2024 at 12:47 AM Vincent Wanga &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>vincen...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On my side, using the same species still brings the same error. I am not sure if the internet restriction can cause the same error, because I am using the Institution internet and VPN</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, Nov 18, 2024 at 1:36 PM Vincent Wanga &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>vincen...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Ok. I am using Acanthochlamys bracteata, a plant species</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, Nov 18, 2024 at 1:34 PM Wallace EcoMod &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>wallac...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Weird, what species are you using?<div>I just tried with <i>Bassaricyon alleni</i> and <i>Bassaricyon neblina </i>under the settings from the image (CCSM4 and Holocene) and it worked. If you give me your species, I can test it out.</div><div>You can also try just typing the URL from the error into your browser and see if it downloads- this might help to figure out if it is a broken link or a Wallace download issue. The ecoclimate files are stored in a dropbox- your browser may have a safeguard set up. The error message seems to indicate it can&#39;t open the URL, but it appears to be working on my end.</div><div><br></div><div>-Bethany</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, Nov 18, 2024 at 12:14 AM Vincent Wanga &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>vincen...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Bethany,<div>Thanks for getting back to me. The issue keeps happening repeatedly, I tried to even download to upload the paleoclimatic data but it still gives me the same error. </div><div>The error message I have screenshot below. The occurrence data I am using is from GBIF. But still cant move past this region.</div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/wallaceEcoMod/attach/4eeba31bab2dd/image.png?part=0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"563\" height=\"294\"><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, Nov 18, 2024 at 1:05 PM Wallace EcoMod &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>wallac...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Vincent,<div>I will need a bit more information to diagnose this issue.</div><div>Did it happen once or is it happening repeatedly?</div><div><br></div><div>Can you tell me what the error message is that is printed in the RStudio console?</div><div><br></div><div>What are you using for your occurrence data- was it from GBIF, another database, or user-uploaded?</div><div><br></div><div>Bethany Johnson</div><div>The Wallace Team</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Sun, Nov 17, 2024 at 10:49 PM Vincent Wanga &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>vincen...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gm